      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "A trait implemented by parser structs.\nParser structs parse a file to a list\nof 'PresentationState's. For this,\nthey also parse structures that rep-\nresent 'Element's into 'ParsedStruct's\nand use them to create actual instan-\nces of structs implementing 'Element'.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
